WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:48.350
Someone once said:

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:53.790
There are Gourmet Jellyfish that live 
in a paradise at the bottom of the sea

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:57.000
and possess a miraculous power.

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:01.270
Gourmet Jellyfish, who can come 
back to life again and again,

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:04.770
changing their body little 
by little, evolving...

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:09.070
And within those creatures who 
have eaten this jellyfish,

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:13.440
the more delicious things they eat,

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:18.880
the higher the vital activity 
level of the regenerating cells...

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:22.890
Creatures that possess Gourmet Cells!

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:26.160
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:31.130
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.460
Ancient Marsh

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.460
No. 1 Gourmet Laboratory

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.460
Entrance to the Regal 
Highlands - The Regal Wall

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.460
Regal Highlands

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.460
Devils' Playground

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.460
White Forest

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.460
Black Carpet

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.460
Mushroom Wood

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:35.600
Questing for the Jewel Meat,

00:02:35.600 --> 00:02:39.100
Toriko's group headed inside 
the body of the Regal Mammoth.

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:44.010
Coco and Sunny fought to 
the brink of their lives

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:47.450
to stop the GT Robots 
controlled by Gido and Cedre,

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:50.420
leaving the capture of 
the Jewel Meat to Toriko.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:56.350
However, Toriko has now 
encountered Starjun's GT Robot!

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:05.030
Rin's Final Wish! Awaken, Super Toriko!

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:09.900
Fragrance Bazooka!

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:18.810
Toriko-san!

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:20.710
Rin-san!

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:40.600
W-What? W-Who is that?

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:42.670
Me?

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:44.740
It's eating me?

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:48.970
The time limit is 5 minutes.

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.910
Hurry and eat something.

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:55.810
Yes...

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:58.680
If possible, something supremely delicious.

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:00.850
The cells will evolve.

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:01.820
What?

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.350
Toriko-san!

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:04.960
Toriko-san!

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:14.730
T-This is...

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:17.040
Endorphin Smoke?

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.200
T-Toriko...

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:23.980
At least I... can ease your pain...

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:24.980
Rin!

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:26.040
Rin-san!

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:27.410
See?

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:31.120
It's also a smokescreen...

00:04:31.380 --> 00:04:34.390
All you guys, escape while 
you have the chance.

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:38.660
You're more worried about us, than yourself?

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:46.330
Hurry up and... escape...

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:54.370
Wait for me, Rin!

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:55.940
Kuruppo!

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.450
Run away, have we?

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:02.310
That's the smart decision.

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:03.510
Tina-san...

00:05:03.510 --> 00:05:06.080
Tina-san... isn't running away!

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:09.150
I'm going to call Coco and Sunny!

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:12.620
The homing instinct of the 
carrier balloon pigeon

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.790
that lets it return from wherever it may be!

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:19.600
With that heaping helping of homing 
power, take me to the exit!

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:24.940
The two of them should have 
beaten the GT Robots by now.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.910
I bet that Sunny's headed outside as well!

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:30.840
If I go outside, I'll definitely 
be able to find them!

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:36.250
At this rate, all the effort and emotions 
we've put in so far will go to waste!

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:38.980
I won't let that happen!

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.180
No matter what!

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:43.090
Rin-san!

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.360
It's no use.

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:49.590
She'll be dead shortly.

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:52.000
Her and Toriko...

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:58.200
If you had just not gotten in 
my way, like the other time...

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:01.240
They wouldn't have had to die.

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:10.050
Hey, who're you sayin's gonna die?

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.090
Toriko-san...

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:20.020
Rin!

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:24.230
T-Toriko...

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:25.700
Don't speak, Rin.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:30.670
T-This scar below my eye...

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:36.370
Man, you've gotta be kiddin' me!

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.980
A Hyena Gang pack, here?

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:44.850
Rin!

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:50.560
Endorphin Smoke!

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.530
You saved my bacon, Rin!

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:03.000
These Silk Bird eggs are as easy 
to crack as soap bubbles, you see.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:03.970
Look there!

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:06.800
You've gotten hurt.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:11.880
You okay?

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:16.750
Sure, I'm fine.

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:20.490
And wow, this wound's in 
the same place as Toriko's!

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:22.090
I'm so happy!

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:28.530
Back then, I thought it was 
the same as yours, Toriko...

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.700
But it was actually opposite 
because of the reflection.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:34.900
Even so, I'm happy.

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:39.340
Because I can be helpful to you 
even at times like this, Toriko.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:42.310
Rin, don't talk any more.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:47.410
Please, Toriko, do me one last thing.

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:50.210
I have a wish...

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:00.860
Fool...

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:05.600
Toriko, her neck should be completely broken.

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:08.600
Please, Toriko.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:11.070
Sure.

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:22.280
Thank you... Tori...ko...

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:25.950
What is this?

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:28.550
Could it be...

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:31.260
The power of that attack...

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:38.930
GT Robot!

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:41.670
GT Robot!

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:44.300
Fork!

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:51.080
Knife!

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:56.780
1, 2, 3, 4, 5...

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:58.250
6!

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:02.250
6-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:14.500
Rin was always prepared to die.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:18.670
It's always right beside all living things.

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:25.540
You, who are not prepared to die, 
have no right to live in this world!

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:29.780
I'll make sure you feel it, all 
the way to where you really are...

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:32.620
Taste the fear of death!

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:39.990
Is this... a coincidence?

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:46.100
Or is it something you were 
purposefully going for, Toriko?

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.000
Either way...

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:54.340
Autophagy has started.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.880
Auto...phagy?

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:03.880
It is a process where creatures 
who are suffering from starvation

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:08.820
break down their own cells 
to gain energy for a time.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:10.920
If autophagy has started, that means...

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:14.390
Were you even purposefully 
fasting, you bastard?

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:19.460
To support your body with 
Gourmet Cells inside of it,

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:26.570
you must need to eat something 
like 200,000 calories a day, yes?

00:10:26.570 --> 00:10:29.940
Therefore, fasting even in the slightest

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:34.410
should cause near life-threatening 
damage, however...

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:40.850
Now that I think about it... Toriko 
hasn't been eating anything!

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:44.460
When the Gourmet Cells,

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:50.260
which give you power the more you eat 
delicious food, eat themselves...

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:56.500
In other words, when your Gourmet 
Cells eat your own body...

00:10:56.970 --> 00:11:01.540
It gives your body incredible power.

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:06.740
It's a catalyst for evolving 
the Gourmet Cells.

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:08.650
Fork!

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:10.680
Knife!

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:12.880
Close you up!

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:20.590
W-Wow...

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:23.700
What a bother this is.

00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:27.970
There's a 0.1% error in the response...

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:31.000
I can't fight with my full 
strength through a GT Robot.

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:33.870
Gourmet Hunter Toriko.

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:37.440
You <i>do</i> have power. I admire that.

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:42.250
However, that power won't last for long.

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:48.150
Autophagy is only a temporary 
prevention of starvation.

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:50.290
Your power is increased,

00:11:50.290 --> 00:11:55.990
but if it continues for long, your cells 
will be devoured and you will die.

00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:59.460
Autophagy is a double-edged sword.

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:02.830
Will your Gourmet Cells hyper-evolve?

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:05.300
Or will you just die?

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:09.470
Can you defeat me within the time limit?

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.050
The time limit is five minutes.

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:18.180
Not possible, is it?

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:26.460
Mixer Punch!

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:32.430
1...

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:33.360
2...

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:34.530
3...

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:36.170
4...

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:37.540
5...

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:38.640
6...

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:40.070
7-

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:44.780
N-Not enough power...

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:50.920
It looks like that's as far as you go.

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:54.290
No evolution for you.

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:58.420
Farewell, Gourmet Hunter Toriko!

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:00.630
Toriko-san!

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:06.830
Toriko-san!

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:16.210
Could that be...?

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:21.450
Toriko!

00:13:32.090 --> 00:13:34.090
T-That's...

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:35.990
Coco, what's wrong?

00:13:35.990 --> 00:13:38.860
A giant electromagnetic wave... 
A violent disturbance.

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:40.870
Someone is in trouble, you mean?

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:44.270
I cannot tell whose waves it was

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:48.770
from within the vast body of the Regal 
Mammoth and its thick walls of flesh...

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:53.280
But one thing I am sure of, Toriko and 
the others are in a serious crisis!

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:57.250
Damn it, don't do anything crazy!

00:13:57.650 --> 00:14:01.620
If you go now, you'd just hold him back.

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:03.220
I know it's not easy.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:06.120
What in the world is going on?

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:16.230
This is...

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:19.340
Toriko!

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:22.140
Toriko!

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:27.550
H-Hey! Now isn't the time to take a nap!

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:29.080
Wake up!

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:30.950
Hey, Toriko!

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:32.020
Toriko!

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:32.950
He couldn't be...

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:34.050
No...

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:39.520
It can't be true! Toriko!

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:48.100
No, no!

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:52.240
This is when I have to calm down and think!

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:55.310
That's an ironclad rule for 
us Gourmet Newscasters!

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:58.910
No matter what scene we're reporting 
from, we're always calm and composed!

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:00.040
Think!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:01.750
Think, me!

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:19.430
T-That's...

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:27.510
Please, Toriko... Open your eyes!

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:36.950
That deep, rich taste...

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:39.320
That sweet aroma...

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:42.190
Toriko!

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:44.320
Meat juice?

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:48.430
So bright...

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:51.230
This shining light... Could it be...?

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:05.180
Jewel Meat!

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:09.680
T-That's... the Jewel Meat?

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:14.120
Toriko!

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.460
What is this?

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:25.530
In the previous fight, I should have 
used up all my sweat and blood...

00:16:25.530 --> 00:16:28.070
My body should be dying of thirst, and yet...

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:33.370
...I can't stop drooling!

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:36.440
A-Amazing!

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:38.840
What beautiful meat!

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:45.650
The marbling looks like it's been 
hand-layered by craftsman of the highest order!

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:50.490
The dripping meat juice 
is almost like gold dust!

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:56.330
And above all, this aroma...

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:02.970
This mellow fragrance that tops 
the finest brand of perfume...

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:08.170
Its meaty smell pierces deep down 
through my primal instincts!

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:13.880
Ah, thank you, Ancient Food Treasure!

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:15.650
Thank you, Regal Mammoth!

00:17:16.650 --> 00:17:17.720
And...

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:21.720
I give thanks for all this world's bounty...

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:24.060
Time to eat!

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:29.890
So tender...

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:33.300
So moist, it's sticking to my skin.

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:35.400
Knife...

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:40.970
Incredible! The meat juice is flying out!

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:43.470
It's like an explosion of incense!

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.850
Yum...

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:31.060
Yum...!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.660
Yum!!

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:40.060
That section was moist and tender,

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:42.670
but this part is wild and chewy!

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:45.870
The gorgeous sound of chewing 
like biting into a gizzard!

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:51.580
Plus, the flavor and depth of the 
meat juice overflowing in my mouth!

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.780
I can't get enough!

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:58.620
I can't get enough!!

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:07.690
In the end, you're the 
brightest of the bunch, kid.

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:13.130
Even if they don't hurry, humans 
will die sooner or later.

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:17.040
There is no reason to go rushing 
to one's death, after all.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:22.510
You're a chef?

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:30.650
This is an excellent knife.

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:36.750
By looking at your knives, I can 
pretty much tell your skill level...

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:41.630
I see. You're a top-class chef.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.700
You should polish your skills even further!

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:54.070
I pray that one day your skills will be 
put to good use for our Gourmet Corp.

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:57.810
I shall keep this knife.

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:00.450
It looks like it will come in handy.

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:04.750
A-Any...

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:08.350
Anything but... that!

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:13.490
That knife is no different than my life!

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.260
Give it back!

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:20.670
Get in my way and you die.

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:23.600
I'm not afraid of death!

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:27.370
I came here prepared for 
the consequences, too!

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:29.010
Give it back!

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:52.900
Oh? Looks like your conviction is sincere.

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:56.400
Yes. Unlike yours.

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:10.720
In the end, you're the only one who 
wasn't prepared to die, GT Robot!

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:14.590
Toriko!

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:16.450
Toriko-san!

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:38.140
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:44.380
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:51.660
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:56.590
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:21:57.860 --> 00:22:01.670
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:05.040
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:09.510
on a journey with no end!

00:22:11.380 --> 00:22:14.480
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:14.480 --> 00:22:17.620
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:23.660
amid the waves of time.

00:22:26.620 --> 00:22:28.530
Gourmet News!

00:22:29.730 --> 00:22:31.200
Good morning!

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:33.000
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:34.670
The paradise at the bottom of the sea...

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:37.140
Seabottom Octopus

00:22:34.670 --> 00:22:37.470
This octopus inhabits 
the depths of the ocean.

00:22:37.470 --> 00:22:42.010
It was once captured by the 
legendary Gourmet Hunter Acacia,

00:22:42.010 --> 00:22:47.250
and it seemed like it had eaten Gourmet 
Jellyfish, which increased its taste.

00:22:47.250 --> 00:22:49.910
By the way, there is a legend that 
Acacia made it into takoyaki,

00:22:49.910 --> 00:22:55.590
and instead of using sauce 
ate them in a special broth.

00:22:55.590 --> 00:22:58.460
Not Akashiyaki, but Acaciayaki!

00:22:58.760 --> 00:23:00.020
Tee-hee!

00:23:00.460 --> 00:23:02.730
What? Tough crowd?

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:04.700
Now then, on to the next story!

00:23:06.960 --> 00:23:09.830
Is this the end of the battle for the Jewel Meat?!

00:23:09.830 --> 00:23:12.900
Toriko's awakened powers are put on full display!

00:23:12.900 --> 00:23:17.280
Super Toriko, the Fists of Anger! 
This is the Strongest Spiked Punch!

00:23:17.280 --> 00:23:19.520
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
